ding, cable car ride<\/li><li aria-level=\"2\">Winter (seasonal): Skiing, snowboarding, snowmobiles<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li aria-level=\"1\">Enjoy lunch at a resort restaurant or mountain caf\u00e9<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f553.svg\" alt=\"\ud83d\udd53\" \/>\u00a0Afternoon: Return to Baku<\/p><ul><li aria-level=\"1\">Depart from Shahdag around 4:30 PM<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\">Arrive back in Baku around 8:30 PM<\/li><\/ul><p><b>\u00a0\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f37d.svg\" alt=\"\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\" \/><\/b>\u00a0Dinner at local restaurant in Baku<\/p><p>\u00a0\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f3e8.svg\" alt=\"\ud83c\udfe8\" \/>\u00a0Overnight in Baku<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-9523\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-9523\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-caret-down\"><\/i><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-caret-up\"><\/i><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Day 3:Full-Day Gobustan & Absheron Tour<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-9523\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-9523\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f558.svg\" alt=\"\ud83d\udd58\" \/>\u00a0Morning Breakfast at the hotel, depart from Hotel<\/p><p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f9ed.svg\" alt=\"\ud83e\udded\" \/>\u00a0Gobustan National Park (1-hour drive)<\/p><ul><li aria-level=\"1\">Visit:<ul><li aria-level=\"2\">Petroglyph Reserve Museum<\/li><li aria-level=\"2\">Ancient rock carvings (dating back 40,000 years)<\/li><li aria-level=\"2\">Mud Volcanoes (off-road transfer included \u2013 optional)<\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f525.svg\" alt=\"\ud83d\udd25\" \/>\u00a0Continue to Absheron Peninsula<\/p><p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f54c.svg\" alt=\"\ud83d\udd4c\" \/>\u00a0Ateshgah \u2013 Fire Temple<\/p><ul><li aria-level=\"1\">Zoroastrian fire-worship temple near Surakhani<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\">Learn about the region\u2019s fire-worship history<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f525.svg\" alt=\"\ud83d\udd25\" \/>\u00a0Yanar Dag \u2013 Burning Mountain<\/p><ul><li aria-level=\"1\">Natural gas fire that blazes continuously on a hillside<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\">Great photo opportunity and unique geological site<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f553.svg\" alt=\"\ud83d\udd53\" \/>\u00a0Late Afternoon: Return to Baku<\/p><ul><li aria-level=\"1\">Visit Heydar Aliyev Center (optional, photo stop only or quick visit)<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f37d.svg\" alt=\"\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\" \/>\u00a0Dinner at local restaurant in Baku<\/p><p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f3e8.svg\" alt=\"\ud83c\udfe8\" \/>\u00a0Overnight in Baku<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-9524\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-9524\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-caret-down\"><\/i><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-caret-up\"><\/i><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Day 4: Departure in Baku <\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-9524\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-9524\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f558.svg\" alt=\"\ud83d\udd58\" \/>\u00a0Morning<\/p><ul><li aria-level=\"1\">Breakfast at hotel<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\">Free time in the morning \u2013 Free leisure \u2013 last minute shopping<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/c